  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-purpose Cash Assistance for Communities Most Affected by Manila Bay Oil Spill</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is designed to address the most urgent needs of targeted households while their livelihood activities and food sources are severely disrupted and/or damaged by the oil spill. Among the common needs identified by affected households, as articulated during assessments are food and water, and a range of other needs and priorities which vary among households, including other needs on nutrition, WASH, and health care. To enable targeted households to address varying basic needs, multi-purpose cash assistance will be provided so beneficiary households are able to meet their basic needs, and the cash modality will provide them with flexibility to suit their specific needs.</narrative>
  </description>
